# The agent kit's skill files, which show example annotations about the hotel
# examples. They'd otherwise be read as Docket's own evidence. Only their
# Markdown is left out, so the Go code beside it can still be annotated.
# Docket's own docs need no entry: annotations are never read from a Docket
# doc, so the concept docs can show examples freely.
/kit/**/*.md

# The agent kit's skill, written by docket kit. Its examples aren't this project's.
/.agents/skills/docket/**/*.md
